{% extends layout %}
{#
  Refund Policy. The text is version controlled here; its version and date are in
  CattoLearning\Legal\LegalDocuments and must be raised there whenever this text changes, because an
  order records the version its purchaser accepted. The rule stated here is the one
  CattoLearning\Commerce\Domain\RefundRule enforces in the ADMIN refund action; change them together.
#}
{% block page_body %}
	{% set ph_kicker = 'Legal' %}
	{% set ph_title = legal.title %}
	{% set ph_lead = 'When a refund is given, how it is paid and how to ask for one.' %}
	{% include '@platform/partials/page-head.html.twig' %}
	{% set legal_intro = 'This policy applies to every purchase made on this site. It is part of the Terms and Conditions.' %}
	{% set legal_sections = [
		{id: 'rule', label: 'The rule'},
		{id: 'bundles', label: 'Bundles'},
		{id: 'company-credits', label: 'Company credits'},
		{id: 'nothing-paid', label: 'Orders with nothing to pay'},
		{id: 'access', label: 'What happens to your access'},
		{id: 'payment', label: 'How a refund is paid'},
		{id: 'request', label: 'How to ask for a refund'},
		{id: 'your-rights', label: 'Your rights under the law'},
	] %}
	<section class="cl-page-section container cl-medium py-5">
		{% include '@platform/partials/legal-document-head.html.twig' %}

		{% embed ui_template('layout.surface') with {props: ui_props('layout.surface', {section_spacing: true, id: 'rule'})} %}
{% block surface_body %}
			{{ ui('layout.section-head', {heading: '1. The rule'}) }}
			<p>A refund is given only if both of these are true:</p>
			<ol>
				<li>you have not started the course, which means you have not pressed Start course</li>
				<li>fewer than {{ refund_window_days }} days have passed since your purchase</li>
			</ol>
			<p>Once you start the course, or {{ refund_window_days }} days pass, whichever comes first, no refund is given.</p>
			<p>Your purchase is the moment your payment is confirmed. For a payment through Stitch that is when you pay. For a direct EFT it is when we confirm that your payment has arrived in our bank account.</p>
			<p>A refund is the amount you paid for the course. If you used a promo code, that is the price less the discount.</p>
			<p>Unused access time is not refunded.</p>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

		{% embed ui_template('layout.surface') with {props: ui_props('layout.surface', {section_spacing: true, id: 'bundles'})} %}
{% block surface_body %}
			{{ ui('layout.section-head', {heading: '2. Bundles'}) }}
			<p>A bundle is refunded as a whole. A single course in a bundle is not refunded on its own.</p>
			<p>Starting any course in the bundle ends the right to a refund for the whole bundle.</p>
			<p>The same {{ refund_window_days }} days apply to a bundle.</p>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

		{% embed ui_template('layout.surface') with {props: ui_props('layout.surface', {section_spacing: true, id: 'company-credits'})} %}
{% block surface_body %}
			{{ ui('layout.section-head', {heading: '3. Company credits'}) }}
			<p>A refund for company credits is allowed only within {{ refund_window_days }} days of buying the credits, and only for credits that no learner has started.</p>
			<p>A credit that is assigned to a staff member who has not started can be refunded once the Company Administrator removes that staff member from the course. That returns the credit to the company.</p>
			<p>Each refunded credit is refunded at the price the company paid for it. Staff members who have started keep their access.</p>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

		{% embed ui_template('layout.surface') with {props: ui_props('layout.surface', {section_spacing: true, id: 'nothing-paid'})} %}
{% block surface_body %}
			{{ ui('layout.section-head', {heading: '4. Orders with nothing to pay'}) }}
			<p>A free course has nothing to refund. An order that a promo code reduced to nothing has nothing to refund.</p>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

		{% embed ui_template('layout.surface') with {props: ui_props('layout.surface', {section_spacing: true, id: 'access'})} %}
{% block surface_body %}
			{{ ui('layout.section-head', {heading: '5. What happens to your access'}) }}
			<p>When a course or bundle is refunded in full, the access that purchase gave you ends at once. A course you have no other access to leaves your library.</p>
			<p>If you also have access to the same course from another purchase or from your company, that access continues.</p>
			<p>The records of your order, your payment and the refund are kept. Your invoice and receipt stay available under My Orders in your account, and a credit note is added for the refund.</p>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

		{% embed ui_template('layout.surface') with {props: ui_props('layout.surface', {section_spacing: true, id: 'payment'})} %}
{% block surface_body %}
			{{ ui('layout.section-head', {heading: '6. How a refund is paid'}) }}
			<ul>
				<li><strong>You paid through Stitch.</strong> The refund is made through Stitch to the payment method you used, within 7 days of your refund request.</li>
				<li><strong>You paid by direct EFT.</strong> The refund is made by EFT to the bank account your payment came from, less any bank charges we incur, within 7 days of your refund request.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>After we make a refund, your bank may take a few working days to show it in your account.</p>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

		{% embed ui_template('layout.surface') with {props: ui_props('layout.surface', {section_spacing: true, id: 'request'})} %}
{% block surface_body %}
			{{ ui('layout.section-head', {heading: '7. How to ask for a refund'}) }}
			<p>Ask before the {{ refund_window_days }} days end:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>email <a href="mailto:{{ supplier.email }}">{{ supplier.email }}</a></li>
				<li>or use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a></li>
			</ul>
			<p>Give your order number, which starts with CL-, the course or bundle you want refunded and the email address of your account. For company credits, the Company Administrator asks for the company.</p>
			<p>We check your request against the rule above and reply to you.</p>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}

		{% embed ui_template('layout.surface') with {props: ui_props('layout.surface', {id: 'your-rights'})} %}
{% block surface_body %}
			{{ ui('layout.section-head', {heading: '8. Your rights under the law'}) }}
			<p>This policy does not take away a right you have under the Consumer Protection Act 68 of 2008 or the Electronic Communications and Transactions Act 25 of 2002.</p>
			<p>If you are unhappy with a decision about a refund, <a href="{{ legal_documents.terms.path }}#complaints">section 13 of the {{ legal_documents.terms.title }}</a> explains how to complain.</p>
{% endblock %}
{% endembed %}
	</section>
{% endblock %}
